stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  [*] --> normal: 扫描发现注册
  [*] --> stale: 发现注册但目录缺失
  normal --> stale: scan_missing
  stale --> normal: scan_restored
  normal --> hidden: hide
  hidden --> normal: unhide
  stale --> stale_hidden: hide
  stale_hidden --> stale: unhide
  hidden --> stale_hidden: scan_missing
  stale_hidden --> hidden: scan_restored
  normal --> removed: registry_removed
  stale --> removed: registry_removed
  hidden --> removed: registry_removed
  stale_hidden --> removed: registry_removed
  removed --> [*]
  note right of removed
    注册表条目被清即彻底退场(终态)
    失效≠移除:失效仍在注册表里
  end note
